# Shared uv-managed Python venv created by install.sh (ip-check / tt-web deps).
# Runtime artifact — recreated on install, never committed.
.venv/

# pytest lands this at the repo root, because tt-web/README.md documents running
# the suite from here (`pytest tt-web/tests`) rather than from tt-web/.
.pytest_cache/

# EnterWorktree 的受管落点——建在这里的树不是仓库内容
.claude/worktrees/

# Scratch tree hook/skill test runs mkdtemp into; survives a crashed run
.test-tmp/
/claude/hooks/.session-inbox-test-tmp/
/claude/scripts/.peer-session-watch-test-tmp/

# plan 执行过程产物（plan.md / state.md / journal.md）；耐久结论收口时流向 tracked docs/
/plans/

# /custom:supervise 的 real-time log；收口时提炼成 docs/issues/ 条目，日志本身不入仓
/logs/
